      <p class="mh-sc-sub">From setup to scorecard to progress: the whole loop, shown with sample data.</p>
    </div>

    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs>
      <linearGradient id="mh-sc-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5B9BFF"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#A78BFA"/></linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="mh-sc-grad2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5B9BFF"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#A78BFA"/></linearGradient>
    </defs></svg>

    <div class="mh-sc-rail" role="group" aria-label="MedhaIQ product screens, sample data" tabindex="0">
